---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../components/SectionHeader.astro';
import { organization } from '../config/organization';

const updated = 'June 2026';
const email = organization.contact.email;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | N.C.N.G. Model Railroad"
  description="How the Nevada County Narrow Gauge Historical Model Railroad website handles your information."
>
  <section class="page-container section">
    <SectionHeader
      as="h1"
      eyebrow="Privacy"
      title="Privacy policy"
      description={`How this website handles your information. Last updated ${updated}.`}
    />

    <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-5 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        We are an all-volunteer nonprofit, and this is a simple informational
        website. We collect almost nothing about you, we set no tracking
        cookies, and we never sell your information.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl mt-10">What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        The site has no accounts, no logins, and no on-site forms that send data
        to a server we run. The only information we receive is what you choose to
        send us by email, plus anonymous, aggregate traffic counts (described
        below).
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl mt-10">Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to count visits and see which pages are
        popular. It is privacy-first: it sets no cookies, does not fingerprint
        you, and does not track you across sites. We see totals and trends, not
        individual people.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl mt-10">When you contact us</h2>
      <p>
        Our contact and "donate materials" buttons open a message in your own
        email program addressed to us. No website server collects or stores what
        you type. When you send that email, we receive your email address and
        whatever you wrote, and we keep it only as long as we need to reply and
        follow up.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl mt-10">Other services we rely on</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>GitHub Pages</strong> hosts the site. GitHub may log standard request data such as IP addresses to serve and protect the site.</li>
        <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> provides the cookie-free analytics above.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Maps</strong> is embedded on the contact page to show our location. When that page loads, your browser contacts Google, which may receive your IP address and set its own cookies under Google's privacy policy.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Fonts are served from this site, not a third-party font network.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl mt-10">Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This site sets no first-party cookies and uses no advertising or
        cross-site tracking. The one exception is the Google Maps embed on the
        contact page, which may set its own cookies if you open that page.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl mt-10">Children</h2>
      <p>
        We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you
        believe a child has sent us information, email us and we will remove it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl mt-10">Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        To ask what we hold about you, or to have us delete an email you sent us,
        contact us and we will take care of it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl mt-10">Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We will update this page if our practices change, and we will update the
        date at the top.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl mt-10">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about privacy? Email
        <a href={`mailto:${email}`} class="text-primary underline">{email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
